---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTA from '../../components/CTA.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Marketing Partnership: aaron.chat × Roof Pitcher"
  description="Roof Pitcher partners with aaron.chat to deliver the marketing engine inside every Zero-to-50 program. Local SEO, AEO, paid, conversion infrastructure."
>
  <section class="border-b-2 border-ink-900 bg-ink-900 text-white">
    <div class="container-x py-20 grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 items-center">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow text-torch-400">Strategic partner</span>
        <h1 class="mt-3 text-6xl">AARON.CHAT<br/><span class="text-torch-400">× ROOF PITCHER.</span></h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-ink-200 max-w-xl">
          Sales training without marketing is a Ferrari with no gas. Marketing without sales training is a flooded carburetor. The Zero-to-50 program bundles both — Tyler runs sales, <a href="https://aaron.chat" class="text-torch-400">aaron.chat</a> runs marketing.
        </p>
        <a href="/zero-to-50/" class="btn-primary mt-8">See the bundled program →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="border-2 border-torch-500 bg-ink-800 p-7">
        <h2 class="text-2xl">WHY THIS PARTNERSHIP EXISTS</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-ink-200">Roofing owners get pitched marketing services and sales coaching by separate vendors who blame each other when leads don't close. We fixed that. One contract. One dashboard. One throat to choke.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-x py-20 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="card">
      <h3 class="text-2xl">WHAT TYLER OWNS</h3>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-ink-700">
        <li>✓ Rep training, scripts, ride-alongs, certification</li>
        <li>✓ Sales process, CRM workflow, KPI cadence</li>
        <li>✓ Hiring funnel + manager development</li>
        <li>✓ Weekly L10 with owner + manager</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card border-torch-500">
      <h3 class="text-2xl">WHAT AARON.CHAT OWNS</h3>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-ink-700">
        <li>✓ Local SEO + AI Overview optimization (AEO)</li>
        <li>✓ Paid: Meta, Google, YouTube, Nextdoor</li>
        <li>✓ Conversion site + lead capture + instant call routing</li>
        <li>✓ Content infrastructure: case studies, video, schema</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-y-2 border-ink-900 bg-ink-100">
    <div class="container-x py-16 text-center">
      <p class="text-2xl max-w-3xl mx-auto font-display">"Roofers don't have a sales problem and they don't have a marketing problem. They have a <span class="text-torch-600">handoff problem</span>. We built this partnership to fix the handoff."</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">— Tyler & the aaron.chat team</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTA title="Ready to bundle the engine?" cta={{ href: '/zero-to-50/', label: 'See Zero to 50' }} />
</BaseLayout>
